Homepage: https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/Eduka-Desktop
Description: Edukasaun OS desktop: start menu, panel and settings on LXQt
 Eduka-Desktop is the desktop of Edukasaun OS (Debian stable with LXQt):
  * Eduka-Desktop, the start menu with categories, favorites and a search
    that also finds the pages of Eduka-Settings;
  * Eduka-Quick, a round, see-through quick launcher on Super+Q;
  * Eduka-Panel with the task bar, workspaces, the Action Center
    (calendar, weather, time sync, sound, brightness, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and
    drives), the notifications, a clipboard history (Super+V), screen
    recording with sound (Super+Alt+R), Force Close for programs that hang
    and a warning before the memory is full;
  * the LXQt and Windows keyboard shortcuts together, without clashes,
    with window snapping and the sound and media keys (eduka-shortcut);
  * Eduka-Settings with an overview of all settings: user accounts,
    themes, fonts, date and time, the panel, the wallpaper, display scale
    (75 to 200 %) and graphics cards, sound (devices, tests, clear sound
    with EasyEffects, fixes for crackling), windows, workspaces and hot
    corners, keyboard and shortcuts, mouse, touchpad, touch screen, pen
    tablets and gestures, accessibility, fingerprint login, memory,
    drivers and firmware, the SDDM and LightDM login screens, privacy and
    Parental Control;
  * seven desktop themes that also style GTK 2/3/4 and Qt programs and
    the Openbox and xfwm4 window borders, an SDDM login screen with glass
    cards and Edukasaun themes for slick-greeter and lightdm-gtk-greeter.
 .
 It runs inside an LXQt session (startlxqt) with xfwm4 or Openbox (or
 Compiz, installed separately) and, when the computer can, the picom
 compositor. In the LXQt Wayland session the settings also reach labwc
 and KWin. Eduka-Panel replaces lxqt-panel; LXQt provides the session,
 the file manager and its tools.
 .
 This is version 0.11 Pre-Stable (the last step before 0.11 stable).
